'''Hydreigon''' (Japanese: '''サザンドラ''' ''Sazandora'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

