==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Hydreigon|115}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*'''Hyper Ray''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Stellar Crown|Klinklang|101}} from the {{TCG|Stellar Crown}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

